Z||000000||ThatRickGuy||06-13-2000||08:08 AM||||Well, it's really on, the check showedc up yestarday, and there is currently a '88 Formula T-Top sitting in my parking lot. Driving it home was a blast, except the alignment was just slightly off, or possibly a wheel balance problem... hit 75, and she just started shaking like crazy, but it was solid up to that. Felt like I was glued to the road hitting the on ramp to I-95. Suspention is pretty rough in these little cars, I mean, I''m pretty sure it's still stock, but there was no list at all, she just clung to the ground, altho I did manage to feel every little bump in the road. well, it'll be a bit of a challenge to adjust from the '76 lemans,  but I'm up for it.||||reg||1
